crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0a16bef10568356cda605652ce9d720e 2x, https://si.imgix.net/fe973871/uploads/origins/3d4fea16-ee07-4526-994b-f3822a74ee9d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=760f4635522dd30752223b90739cc153 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "いつも大変お世話になっております！\n\n香椎さんとの企画で生まれたOCの緑髪境界男くんのイラストをお願いしたいです！\n\nイラストの内容は香椎さんにお任せします！\n\nホーム画面にしたいのでサイズを縦2360×横1640でお願いできたらと思います、お忙しいところ恐縮ですがご検討いただけると幸いです🙇‍♀️", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@la_C41/works/68", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/5bb0c73f/uploads/origins/e4ee0177-0ad2-44f3-9766-a63678a2a31d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=8f16b157431fb161b7b4fecceb98948d", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/5bb0c73f/uploads/origins/e4ee0177-0ad2-44f3-9766-a63678a2a31d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=8f16b157431fb161b7b4fecceb98948d, https://si.imgix.net/5bb0c73f/uploads/origins/e4ee0177-0ad2-44f3-9766-a63678a2a31d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=29b168a7db8b09a6e71b22c44bc8d4f7 2x, https://si.imgix.net/5bb0c73f/uploads/origins/e4ee0177-0ad2-44f3-9766-a63678a2a31d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=56dada10f66c799e8314c88d1573a114 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@la_C41/works/67", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/04cd48c7/uploads/origins/bbdbf771-e051-40a3-a0e5-d5813b6d2c48?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=20